OL,3,GSouth West
OL,4,
OL,5,CToday:FA few showers are likely in the
OL,6,Fwest at first, otherwise most areas
OL,7,Flook set to have a dry day with sunny
OL,8,Fspells. A brisk northwesterly wind
OL,9,Fwill ease, and feeling pleasant enough
OL,10,Fin the sunshine.
OL,11,
OL,12,CTonight:FThe evening will start fine
OL,13,Fwith some sunshine, and clear spells
OL,14,Fare likely overnight. However, cloud
OL,15,Fwill increase from the west, with
OL,16,Fpatchy rain arriving across west Devon
OL,17,Fand Cornwall.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
OL,24,ANext Page  BWeather  CReg News  FReg TV
