OL,3,GSouth West
OL,4,
OL,5,CThursday:FEarly sunshine is likely in
OL,6,Fthe east on Thursday. However, cloud
OL,7,Fand patchy rain will spread from the
OL,8,Fwest, heralding an increasingly wet
OL,9,Fand breezy afternoon. Heavier rain
OL,10,Farriving later.
OL,11,
OL,12,COutlook for Friday to Sunday:FFriday
OL,13,Fsees a return to much brighter skies
OL,14,Fwith lighter winds. A spell of wet and
OL,15,Fwindy weather arrives Saturday night,
OL,16,Fwith the brighter, showery set up back
OL,17,Ffor Sunday.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
